  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Change by Degrees are the consultants engaged by Climate Unit to prepare Ireland&#x2019;s international climate finance roadmap. The roadmap is a commitment of the Programme for Government and will guide progress towards Ireland&#x2019;s climate finance targets for 2025 and 2030. It is a cross-departmental effort led by the Department of Foreign Affairs. Work on the roadmap began in 2021 and will conclude in the first half of 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
